OL,3,AIrish reality star dances her way to   
OL,4,Afinal of Dancing with the Stars        
OL,6,FThe Irish reality TV star has cha cha  
OL,7,Fcha'd her way to the final of Dancing  
OL,8,FWith the Stars on US television, where 
OL,9,Fshe will compete with her professional 
OL,10,Fdance partner Mark Ballas, son of      
OL,11,FStrictly head judge Shirley Ballas.    
